Population pyramids display graphically the population by group age and sex. The
horizontal bar shows the number or ratio of men and women for e ach age group. The sum of all age
groups and genders from the population pyramid is 100%.
Median Age
Before calculating the median a ge, we need to divide the popula tion into two equal size
groups (50% vs. 50%), one of which is younger and other of which older than median.
